WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:06.110
In the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, Amen.

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:14.790
The reading from the Sinaxadion, per September 5th, on which we commemorate, saints Zacharias

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:22.300
the Prophet and Elizabeth, the parents of the Forerunner.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:28.380
On the 5th of the month we celebrate the memory of the Holy and Glorious Prophet Zacharias,

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:33.620
Father of Saint John the Baptist and Forerunner.

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:40.740
Zacharias was a Levite, descended from the High Priest, a Biyathar, and lived in Jerusalem

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:45.180
with his wife Elizabeth of the lineage of Aaron.

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:51.700
They were both righteous and observed all the commandments of the Lord with love, but had

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:56.660
remained childless until their old age.

00:00:56.660 --> 00:01:03.060
It happened on the great holy day of the atonement that Zacharias to fulfill his

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:11.340
ministration as High Priest had gone alone into the sanctuary to burn incense when the

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:19.700
Archangel Gabriel appeared to him, standing on the right side of the altar of incense.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:26.300
Shining with the divine light, the angel told him that God had heard his prayers and those

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:33.660
of his wife Elizabeth, and that he had granted them a son in their old age, who was to be

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:36.660
called John.

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:44.220
He will be filled with the Holy Spirit, even from his mother's womb, the angel announced,

00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:50.660
and will go before the Lord to make ready a people prepared for him.

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:57.900
Zacharias was amazed at this vision and wondered whether to believe what he heard, so the angel

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:05.100
took away his power of speech until the birth of the Forerunner in order to teach him not

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:11.300
to doubt divine promises that surpass the order of nature.

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:17.340
Zacharias regained his speech on the day of the child's birth while he was writing the

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:26.420
name John on a tablet, and full of the Holy Spirit, he intoned the prophetic canticle.

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:33.700
Blessed be the Lord God of Israel, for he has visited and redeemed his people, and has raised

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:41.420
up a horn of salvation for us in the house of his servant David, as he spoke by the mouth

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:48.460
of his holy prophets from of old, and you, child, will be called the prophet of the most

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:55.860
high, for you will go before the Lord to prepare his ways, to give knowledge of salvation to

00:02:55.860 --> 00:03:00.020
his people in the forgiveness of their sins.

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:05.980
Through the tender mercy of our God, when the day shall dawn upon us from on high, to give

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:13.300
light to those who sit in darkness and in the shadow of death, to guide our feet into

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:17.060
the way of peace.

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:24.060
After the birth of Christ, Zacharias plainly declared the virginity of Mary and showed her

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:32.180
truly to be the mother of God, for he appointed her a place in that part of the temple, reserved

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:40.220
for the virgins, and so brought upon himself the hatred of the priests and Levites.

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:49.140
When John was six months old, Zacharias hid him and his mother in a cave beyond the Jordan,

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:55.660
because King Herod, hearing of the birth in Bethlehem of the King of the Jews, and fearing

00:03:55.700 --> 00:04:02.900
a rival of his own worldly power, sent soldiers to kill all the male children of Bethlehem.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:10.900
His enemies seized this opportunity to denounce Zacharias to Herod, who had him pursued, and

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:18.100
put to death within the precinct of the temple, at the very place where the mother of God

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:21.940
abode for a witness to her virginity.

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:28.940
As the prophets blood flowed within the sanctuary, it signified the withdrawing of the divine

00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:30.820
presence.

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:35.820
Priests came to take up his body, and they buried him with his fathers.

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:42.340
From that moment signs and prodigies occurred in the temple, indicating that the rights of

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:46.140
the law would soon be abolished.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:53.420
No longer would the priests behold the angels of God, or have the grace of prophecy.

00:04:53.420 --> 00:05:01.140
No longer would they be able to deliver oracles, or enlighten the people upon the dark places

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:06.940
of Holy Scripture, as they had been wont to do.

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:14.340
Through the prayers of our Holy Father's, O Lord, Jesus Christ our God, have mercy on us,

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:15.340
and save us.
